                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-sibling-dates" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1888-03-13T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1888-01-01T00:00:00-05:00">__________
                        ___18—</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">To _______ _______,<lb/>_______
                        _______:</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In reply to your letter of _____ ____,
                    relating to the return of naturalized citizens of the United States to their
                    native country, I send you the following circular, which contains all the
                    information the Department is competent to give in regard to the subject of your
                    inquiry.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <p>_____ ______.</p>




